    "reason": "[ev-d6a3846e479f] is a single bullet saying only that `preferServerCipherSuites` \"has been removed\", under Dynamic configuration › Deprecated Options Removal. It doesn't say which configuration surface this covers or what happens to configs that still set the option, such as being rejected or silently ignored. The CRD validator also found that TLSOption spec.preferServerCipherSuites is still in the v3.0.0 schema [ev-011956bb7059], which contradicts the proposals' reading that the CRD field was removed. More evidence is needed: the actual code or config change showing where the option was removed, plus the behaviour when it is still set.",
